    "sections": {
        "description": "Medical Store is a clean, fast, and highly customizable free theme built specifically for medical store, online pharmacy, drugstore, health supplement shop, medical supplies shop, healthcare eCommerce website, medicine shop, and pharmacy store online. Designed with the powerful WooCommerce plugin, this theme gives users complete flexibility to build stunning, professional eCommerce websites without writing a single line of code. This responsive theme ensures optimal viewing across all devices, from desktops to smartphones. It integrates seamlessly with Contact Form 7 and supports WPML for multi-language readiness, making it easy to manage customer communication globally. With intuitive design and product-focused layouts, Medical Store makes it simple for customers to browse medical equipment, healthcare products, health supplements, and pharmacy items. The theme includes multiple homepage sections such as a hero banner, product categories, featured products, testimonials, newsletter signup, and a contact section. Built with speed, clean code, and SEO optimization in mind, Medical Store helps your website load faster and rank higher on search engines. Whether you’re starting a new online pharmacy or taking your local medical business online, Medical Store is the perfect free theme that combines simplicity, performance, and modern design, offering a reliable foundation for any healthcare eCommerce store.https://preview.wpelemento.com/medical-store/"
    },
